1
00:00:00,712 --> 00:00:03,502
(Penny:)She's adorable, Howard.
I think you'll like her.

2
00:00:03,673 --> 00:00:05,053
(Penny:)Great.

3
00:00:05,342 --> 00:00:08,052
(Howard:)What did you tell her about me?
Did you mention body fat?

4
00:00:08,928 --> 00:00:11,768
(Penny:)No, I thought
that'd be a nice surprise for her.

5
00:00:11,931 --> 00:00:14,931
(Howard:)Good, good.

6
00:00:17,228 --> 00:00:20,688
I told her you're an aerospace engineer,
you speak five languages--

7
00:00:20,857 --> 00:00:22,397
(Howard:)Six, if you count Klingon.

8
00:00:23,151 --> 00:00:25,191
(Leonard:)Girls don't count Klingon, Howard.

9
00:00:25,362 --> 00:00:27,032
(Leonard:)-Right?
-Right.

10
00:00:28,865 --> 00:00:32,285
(Penny:)And I told her you have
an unhealthy attachment to your mother.

11
00:00:32,452 --> 00:00:34,452
(Leonard:)-What?
-I'm kidding.

12
00:00:36,081 --> 00:00:38,371
(Leonard:)Another delightful surprise for her.

13
00:00:43,421 --> 00:00:45,421
(Raj:)Sheldon, it's your play.

14
00:00:46,549 --> 00:00:48,259
(Leonard:)Sheldon.

15
00:00:48,927 --> 00:00:51,717
(Sheldon:)My Enchanted Troll bludgeons
your Screaming Harpy...

16
00:00:51,888 --> 00:00:53,428
(Sheldon:)...with a Cursed Mace. Game.

17
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:58,640
(Raj:)Sorry, boys. Say hi to your mother
when she picks you up.

18
00:00:58,812 --> 00:01:03,022
(Raj:)Or I could just tell her later tonight.
Ha-ha-ha.

